==Package management and installation==
Information on features in the distributions. [[Package manager|Package]] numbers are only approximate. Some distributions like [[Debian]] tend to separate tools into different packages – usually stable release, development release, documentation and debug. Also counting the source package number varies. For Debian and [[RPM Package Manager]] (RPM) based entries it is just the base to produce binary packages, so the total number of packages is the number of binary packages. For Arch based entries, it is additional.
